      "18 Nov": 1,
      "Pope Saint Pontian": 1,
      "The Maronite calendar remembers Pope Saint Pontian on November 19. Pontian led the Church of Rome from the year 230. During persecution he was exiled to Sardinia, where he resigned his office. He died in exile in 235 and was honored in Rome as a martyr.": 1,
      "Brief account based on Vatican News (Spanish). The date follows the Maronite calendar.": 1,
